1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,971
The Doppler effect is the apparent change in frequency when the source, the observer, or both, move relative to the medium.

2
00:00:08,971 --> 00:00:12,083
The source never changes its own frequency.

3
00:00:12,083 --> 00:00:14,778
Only the frequency received changes.

